WEBVTT

00:12:29.676 --> 00:12:34.196
You have to exhaust yourself
of every possibility within your control.

00:12:34.756 --> 00:12:36.876
You know, and after that,
you have to let go.

00:12:36.876 --> 00:12:39.556
I'll give you an example,
I mention it in the book.

00:12:39.556 --> 00:12:42.036
There was a moment,
my parents were in jail.

00:12:42.076 --> 00:12:44.436
I'm 21 years old, I have to leave school.

00:12:44.436 --> 00:12:46.316
I'm taking care of my grandparents,

00:12:46.356 --> 00:12:48.356
my grandmothers, who used to live with me.

00:12:48.396 --> 00:12:49.556
I'm an only child.

00:12:49.596 --> 00:12:51.436
I have to care of the family business,

00:12:51.436 --> 00:12:52.756
I have to pay the lawyer.

00:12:52.796 --> 00:12:57.076
It's post-9/11, my community
turns vicious and cruel.

00:12:57.116 --> 00:12:59.196
Bad news travels fast,
ladies and gentlemen,

00:12:59.236 --> 00:13:00.796
bad news travels fast.